abstract: >-
  A repository of Krytronx Quantum K-Field research, experimental methods,
  instrumentation, signal-analysis workflows, geometric models, datasets,
  software, and associated materials connecting foundational physics with
  quantum sensing, precision metrology, gravitation, astronomy, optics,
  materials science, data science, and systems engineering.

